From: =?UTF-8?q?Berkay=20K=C3=B6sebay?= <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 21:23:52 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Bluetooth: hci_bcm: Add iPad 5 (J71t) BCM4355C0
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The iPad 5 BCM4355C0 comes up with the same sequence as the iPad 7
(J172) BCM4355C1: BT_WAKE asserted before BT_REG_ON is cycled, the
operational baud rate set before the patchram download, and the broken
LE Read Transmit Power and reserved advertising report bits handled by
the existing quirks. This was validated on the device, so reuse the
J172 device data for the J71t board compatible.

The device address comes from the standard local-bd-address property,
which the bootloader fills from the Apple device tree.

Signed-off-by: Berkay Kösebay <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
[Orchard: from brkosebay/linux 968128fb (J71t ledger 4.2); renamed
 the compatible to apple,j71t-bcm4355c0-bt and kept only the match
 entry, as the J172 data and its flags are already in the base.
 The btbcm address and firmware changes (a995669a, 93fb55b0) are not
 taken: m1n1 provides local-bd-address]
Co-developed-by: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Signed-off-by: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/bluetooth/hci_bcm.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/bluetooth/hci_bcm.c b/drivers/bluetooth/hci_bcm.c
index 588884c34..d1634b2bc 100644
--- a/drivers/bluetooth/hci_bcm.c
+++ b/drivers/bluetooth/hci_bcm.c
@@ -1685,6 +1685,9 @@ static const struct of_device_id bcm_bluetooth_of_match[] = {
 	{ .compatible = "brcm,bcm43438-bt", .data = &bcm43438_device_data },
 	{ .compatible = "brcm,bcm4349-bt", .data = &bcm43438_device_data },
 	{ .compatible = "brcm,bcm43540-bt", .data = &bcm4354_device_data },
+	/* The iPad 5 BCM4355C0 needs the same sequence as the iPad 7 C1. */
+	{ .compatible = "apple,j71t-bcm4355c0-bt",
+	  .data = &bcm4355_j172_device_data },
 	{ .compatible = "apple,j71b-bcm4355c1-bt",
 	  .data = &bcm4355_j71b_device_data },
 	{ .compatible = "apple,j172-bcm4355c1-bt",
